    "body": "`TestUnknownLiteral` is declared inside `module Idl`, but the class definition is not indented under the module. This violates standard Ruby indentation and is likely to be flagged by RuboCop/formatters used elsewhere in this gem. Either indent the class/method body under the module, or drop the module wrapper and reference `Idl::UnknownLiteral` explicitly (consistent with other tests in `tools/ruby-gems/idlc/test/`).",
